cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ImageSL: DAB immunohistochemistry staining quantification"
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Sam"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Image-SL/ImageSL"
url: "https://imagesl.com"
abstract: >-
  ImageSL quantifies DAB-positive area in immunohistochemistry images. It
  performs automatic background and tissue segmentation, colour deconvolution,
  and area-based positivity measurement over the whole imaged field, with an
  adjustable sensitivity ladder and optional manual include/exclude regions.
  Analysis runs entirely on the local machine.
keywords:
  - immunohistochemistry
  - DAB
  - digital pathology
  - image analysis
  - quantification
  - colour deconvolution
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.2
